In order to study the structural characteristics of the framework as a function of $\mathbf{CO}_{2}$ loading, detailed powder diffraction experiments (10 K) were carried out on $\mathrm{Fe}_{2}\big(\mathrm{dobdc}\big)$ using a highresolution neutron diffractometer. Analysis of data obtained from the bare framework revealed no excess scattering density
